{section: A}
[Am]Mañana me voy a Lima, Rosau[C]ra, || Tomorrow I'm going to Lima, Rosaura,
¿qué color quieres tu manta, [Em7]Lindau[Am]ra? || what colour do you want your shawl, Lindaura?
[Am]Celeste como el cielo, Rosau[C]ra, || Sky-blue like the sky, Rosaura,
verde como la esperanza, [Em7]Lindau[Am]ra. || green like hope, Lindaura.

{section: B (×2, kao A)}
[F]Siempre me da la platita, Rosau[^C]ra, || She always gives me a little money, Rosaura,
[^F]para traer las cositas, [G]Lindau[C]ra. || to bring back the little things, Lindaura.
[Am]Mas cuando llego a la Lima, Rosau[C]ra, || But when I get to Lima, Rosaura,
qué rica borracherita, [E7]Lindau[Am]ra. || what a lovely little binge, Lindaura!

{section: C (×2)}
[C]Cómo no te he de querer, cholita, || How could I not love you, cholita,
cómo no te he de amar, negrita, || how could I not adore you, my dark one,
al verte tan buenamoza, chura, || seeing you so lovely, my pretty one,
de cara [E7]tan regu[Am]lar. || with such a fine face.
